Subject: [PATCH] feat: bound large-parameter HCCL weight transfers

Split dense parameters across fixed-capacity slots and reconstruct independently owned loader inputs within a transport storage budget. Preserve native loading and legacy behavior by default.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex
Signed-off-by: Xingjian Guo <7291967@qq.com>
